### 脚本目录:脚本本身入库,**运行时产物不入库** (2026-09-12 起;原先整目录排除 scripts/) ###
scripts/**/__pycache__/
### tools/ 同理(2026-10-01):`python tools/<x>.py` 会在 tools/ 下留 __pycache__,
### 原先只有 scripts/ 被覆盖 ⇒ tools/__pycache__ 每次都冒成未跟踪文件。
tools/**/__pycache__/
scripts/temp/
scripts/devtools/tmp/
scripts/test/reports/*
!scripts/test/reports/_template.md
scripts/test/cases/.mt_*
scripts/test/mt.conf
scripts/test/mt.conf.bak

